= Collaborative editing <features-collaborative-editing>
#set heading(outlined: false)

Several people edit the same project at once, as in Google Docs.

- You see the others' cursors with their names, and their edits as they type.
- The file panel shows the initials of who is in which file.
- Comments are text, so they are shared too.
- *Everyone compiles the same main file:* "Set as main file" changes it for all.
- *Undo reverts only your own edits.*

To try it in the demo, pick "Collaborate" in the playground bar, then "Open a second window as Bob".
